ets\" to pull.","asset":"The ERC1155 asset to pull.","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction.","ids":"The ids of \"assets\" to pull.","locker":"The locker to pull from."}},"pullERC721(address,address,uint256,bytes)":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"asset":"The NFT contract.","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction.","locker":"The locker to pull from.","tokenId":"The NFT tokenId to pull."}},"pullMulti(address,address[],bytes[])":{"details":"This function SHOULD pull the entire balance of each \"asset\" from the locker.Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"assets":"The assets to pull.","data":"Accompanying transaction data.","locker":"The locker to pull from."}},"pullMultiERC721(address,address[],uint256[],bytes[])":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"assets":"The NFT contract(s).","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction(s).","locker":"The locker to pull from.","tokenIds":"The NFT tokenId(s) to pull."}},"pullMultiPartial(address,address[],uint256[],bytes[])":{"details":"The input \"amounts\" might represent a ratio, BIPS, or an absolute amount, depending on the context.Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"amounts":"The amount(s) to pull (may not refer to \"asset\", rather a different asset within the locker).","assets":"The asset(s) to pull.","data":"Accompanying transaction data.","locker":"The locker to pull from."}},"pullPartial(address,address,uint256,bytes)":{"details":"The input \"amount\" might represent a ratio, BIPS, or an absolute amount, depending on the context.Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"amount":"The amount to pull (may not refer to \"asset\", but rather a different asset within the locker).","asset":"The asset to pull.","data":"Accompanying transaction data.","locker":"The locker to pull from."}},"push(address,address,uint256,bytes)":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"amount":"The amount of \"asset\" to push.","asset":"The ERC20 token to push.","data":"Accompanying transaction data.","locker":"The locker to push an ERC20 token to."}},"pushERC1155(address,address,uint256[],uint256[],bytes)":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"amounts":"The amounts of \"assets\" to push.","asset":"The ERC1155 asset to push to locker.","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction.","ids":"The ids of \"assets\" to push.","locker":"The locker to push ERC1155 assets to."}},"pushERC721(address,address,uint256,bytes)":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"asset":"The NFT contract.","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction.","locker":"The locker to push an NFT to.","tokenId":"The NFT tokenId to push."}},"pushMulti(address,address[],uint256[],bytes[])":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"amounts":"The amount of \"asset\" to push.","assets":"The assets to push to locker.","data":"Accompanying transaction data.","locker":"The locker to push capital to."}},"pushMultiERC721(address,address[],uint256[],bytes[])":{"details":"Only the owner (TimelockController) can call this. MUST be marked onlyOwner and nonReentrant.","params":{"assets":"The NFT contract(s).","data":"Accompanying data for the transaction(s).","locker":"The locker to push NFTs to.","tokenIds":"The NFT tokenId(s) to push."}},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only 